Theorem DP-4: needs_cow_check truth table — Uniqueness = MaybeShared

  Preconditions:
    - s is a canonical AimsState per Annex E §AIMS product lattice
    - needs_cow_check : AimsState -> Bool per Annex E §AIMS DP-4 +
      Appendix C truth table
    - DP-4 is a pure boolean predicate over Uniqueness alone; Access /
      Consumption / Cardinality / Locality / Shape / Effect are
      non-load-bearing for the DP-4 obligation
    - Uniqueness carrier (Annex E §AIMS): {Unique, MaybeShared, Shared}
      with partial order Unique ≤ MaybeShared ≤ Shared
    - DP-4 is distinct from DP-5 / DP-9; DP-4 is the runtime-check gate;
      DP-5 + DP-9 compose Uniqueness with borrow_sources +
      project_alias_sources + IC-3 ParamContract.uniqueness for COW
      emission decisions

  Soundness property:
    Forall s in AimsState (canonical).
      needs_cow_check(s)
        <=> s.uniqueness = MaybeShared

    Static fast path: Uniqueness = Unique -> no runtime check (DP-4 =
      false); in-place mutation safe by construction.
    Static slow path: Uniqueness = Shared -> no runtime check (DP-4 =
      false); unconditional copy (the runtime check would always return
      true).
    Dynamic check path: Uniqueness = MaybeShared -> runtime IsShared check
      (DP-4 = true); branch to in-place / copy at runtime.

  Proof obligation:
    Two-part discharge:
      (a) Exhaustive enumeration over the 3-value Uniqueness carrier per
          Appendix C truth table.
      (b) For each Uniqueness value, verify the predicate value equals the
          Appendix C row partition value AND verify exactly one row yields
          true (the MaybeShared row).

    Part (a) — Appendix C row partition (3 rows, exhaustive):
      Row 1: Uniqueness = Unique -> false (static unique fast path)
        Soundness: IsShared on Unique always returns false; runtime check
        would be tautologically false. DP-4 = false signals: skip runtime
        check, emit in-place mutation directly.
      Row 2: Uniqueness = MaybeShared -> true (runtime IsShared check)
        Soundness: runtime IsShared check determines aliasing at the
        mutation point; branch to in-place (RC = 1) or clone-then-mutate
        (RC > 1). DP-4 = true signals: emit IsShared + Branch +
        Set / Clone-Set.
      Row 3: Uniqueness = Shared -> false (static shared slow path)
        Soundness: IsShared on Shared always returns true; runtime check
        would be tautologically true. DP-4 = false signals: skip runtime
        check, emit unconditional copy.

    Part (b) — negative-direction witness:
      DP-4 = true on EXACTLY the MaybeShared row; Unique and Shared both
      return false. The single-row partition is the gate-tightness witness.
      Coverage: 3 enumerated states; 1 true row; 2 false rows.

    DP-4 vs RL-6 / RL-7 / RL-8 mapping (downstream RC emission):
      DP-4 = false AND Uniqueness = Unique -> RL-6 (in-place mutation, no
        check).
      DP-4 = true AND Uniqueness = MaybeShared -> RL-7 (dynamic COW: emit
        IsShared check, branch to in-place / copy).
      DP-4 = false AND Uniqueness = Shared -> RL-8 (unconditional copy).
      The DP-4 truth table mechanically determines the COW emission rule
      per Annex E §AIMS RL-6 / RL-7 / RL-8.

    DP-4 vs DP-9 distinction:
      DP-4 is the BINARY runtime-check predicate (yes / no). DP-9 is the
      THREE-VALUE cow_mode classification (StaticUnique / StaticShared /
      Dynamic) that composes Uniqueness with DP-5 alias safety + IC-3
      ParamContract.uniqueness. DP-9 row (c) MaybeShared + IC-3.uniqueness =
      Unique -> StaticUnique can override the DP-4 = true verdict at the
      cow_mode classification layer; DP-4 itself remains the boolean
      runtime-check gate evaluated PRIOR to DP-9 composition.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (PRIMARY — 3-state enumeration over Uniqueness per
        section_05::verify_dp4_cow_check; the verifier checks the
        soundness equality on every Uniqueness value + asserts exactly 1
        row yields true)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_05 case_analysis engine discharges DP-4 via 3-state enumeration over Uniqueness per Annex E §AIMS DP-4 + Appendix C; exactly 1 row (MaybeShared) requires runtime COW check
